==Description==

<div class="mw-translate-fuzzy">
La commande [[Image:Silk_StarTrim_CubicNStar.svg|32px]] '''Silk StarTrim CubicNStar''' crée un objet StarTrim_CubicNStar à partir d'un objet CubicNStarSurface_NStar66.
</div>

[[Image:Silk_CubicNStarSurface_NStar66-01.png|200px]] [[Image:Button_right.svg|16px|link=]]
[[Image:Silk_StarTrim_CubicNStar-01.png|200px]]

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
{{Caption|A [[Silk_CubicNStarSurface_NStar66|blended corner surface]] → Resulting blended corner collar}}
</div>

<span id="Usage"></span>
==Utilisation==

<div class="mw-translate-fuzzy">
# Sélectionnez une [[Image:Silk_CubicNStarSurface_NStar66.svg|16px]] [[Silk_CubicNStarSurface_NStar66/fr|CubicNStarSurface_NStar66]]
# Il existe plusieurs façons de lancer la commande.
#* Cliquez sur le bouton {{Button|[[Image:Silk_StarTrim_CubicNStar.svg|16px]] StarTrim_CubicNStar}}.
#* Sélectionnez l'option {{MenuCommand|Silk → [[Image:Silk_StarTrim_CubicNStar.svg|16px]] StarTrim_CubicNStar}} du menu.
# Un objet '''StarTrim_CubicNStar''' est créé.
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
===Notes===
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* If eliminating pinching in poor corner geometry is required in a [[Image:Silk_CubicNStarSurface_NStar66.svg|16px]] [[Silk_CubicNStarSurface_NStar66|blended multi corner surface]], this tool can cut-out its center, leaving a collar that can be patched with a standard Filling surface.
: (- Which tool(s) could be used, and how to obtain the edge curves? -)
</div>

